    "Exports include approved screenshots and notes. Deleting evidence in ScreenClip does not delete the agent's own conversation history or PRs.": {
      "comment": "Explains export contents. Keep PRs.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exports include approved screenshots and notes. Deleting evidence in ScreenClip does not delete the agent's own conversation history or PRs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出会包含已批准的截图和备注。在 ScreenClip 中删除证据不会删除代理自己的对话历史或 PR。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las exportaciones incluyen capturas aprobadas y notas. Borrar evidencia en ScreenClip no borra el historial del agente ni los PR."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "書き出しには承認済みスクリーンショットとメモが含まれます。ScreenClip で証拠を削除しても、エージェント側の会話履歴や PR は削除されません。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As exportações incluem capturas aprovadas e notas. Apagar evidências no ScreenClip não apaga o histórico do agente nem os PRs."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exporte enthalten freigegebene Screenshots und Notizen. Belege in ScreenClip zu löschen entfernt nicht den Gesprächsverlauf des Agenten oder PRs."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les exports incluent les captures approuvées et les notes. Supprimer des preuves dans ScreenClip n’efface pas l’historique de l’agent ni les PR."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "내보내기에는 승인된 스크린샷과 메모가 포함됩니다. ScreenClip에서 증거를 삭제해도 에이전트의 대화 기록이나 PR은 삭제되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Экспорт включает одобренные снимки и заметки. Удаление материалов в ScreenClip не удаляет историю агента и PR."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯出會包含已核准的截圖和備註。在 ScreenClip 中刪除證據不會刪除代理自己的對話紀錄或 PR。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
