            "value": "Die Adresse muss mit https beginnen. Kopiere die Webhook-URL aus der Routine ScreenClip reports."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’adresse doit commencer par https. Copiez l’URL du webhook depuis la routine ScreenClip reports."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "주소는 https로 시작해야 합니다. ScreenClip reports 루틴에서 Webhook URL을 복사하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Адрес должен начинаться с https. Скопируйте URL вебхука из процедуры ScreenClip reports."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位址必須以 https 開頭。請從 ScreenClip reports 例程複製 Webhook URL。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Authorization header can't contain a line break. Copy the single-line value from the ScreenClip reports routine.": {
      "comment": "ScreenClip interface text.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Authorization header can't contain a line break. Copy the single-line value from the ScreenClip reports routine."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authorization 标头不能包含换行。请从 ScreenClip reports 例程复制单行值。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El encabezado Authorization no puede contener un salto de línea. Copia el valor de una sola línea de la rutina ScreenClip reports."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authorization ヘッダーに改行は含められません。ScreenClip reports ルーチンから 1 行の値をコピーしてください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O cabeçalho Authorization não pode ter uma quebra de linha. Copie o valor de uma linha da rotina ScreenClip reports."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Authorization-Header darf keinen Zeilenumbruch enthalten. Kopiere den einzeiligen Wert aus der Routine ScreenClip reports."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’en-tête Authorization ne peut pas contenir de saut de ligne. Copiez la valeur sur une seule ligne depuis la routine ScreenClip reports."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authorization 헤더에는 줄바꿈이 들어갈 수 없습니다. ScreenClip reports 루틴에서 한 줄 값을 복사하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Заголовок Authorization не может содержать перевод строки. Скопируйте однострочное значение из процедуры ScreenClip reports."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authorization 標頭不能包含換行。請從 ScreenClip reports 例程複製單行值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the Webhook URL on one line and the Authorization header on the next. Copy both from the ScreenClip reports routine in Grok Bot.": {
      "comment": "ScreenClip interface text.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste the Webhook URL on one line and the Authorization header on the next. Copy both from the ScreenClip reports routine in Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请把 Webhook URL 放在一行，下一行放 Authorization 标头。两者都从 Grok Bot 的 ScreenClip reports 例程复制。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pega la URL del webhook en una línea y el encabezado Authorization en la siguiente. Copia ambos de la rutina ScreenClip reports en Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Webhook URL を 1 行目に、Authorization ヘッダーを次の行に貼り付けてください。どちらも Grok Bot の ScreenClip reports ルーチンからコピーします。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cole a URL do webhook em uma linha e o cabeçalho Authorization na seguinte. Copie os dois da rotina ScreenClip reports no Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Füge die Webhook-URL in eine Zeile ein und den Authorization-Header in die nächste. Kopiere beides aus der Routine ScreenClip reports in Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collez l’URL du webhook sur une ligne et l’en-tête Authorization sur la suivante. Copiez les deux depuis la routine ScreenClip reports dans Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Webhook URL은 한 줄에, Authorization 헤더는 다음 줄에 붙여 넣으세요. 둘 다 Grok Bot의 ScreenClip reports 루틴에서 복사합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Вставьте URL вебхука на одну строку, а заголовок Authorization — на следующую. Скопируйте оба из процедуры ScreenClip reports в Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請把 Webhook URL 放在一行，下一行放 Authorization 標頭。兩者都從 Grok Bot 的 ScreenClip reports 例程複製。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add the webhook URL too. Copy it from the ScreenClip reports routine and paste it with the Authorization header.": {
